# Ninjutsu puts the Ninja onto the battlefield attacking what the returned creature attacked (CR 702.49a, 508.4); if that
# planeswalker is no longer on the battlefield as the ability resolves, the Ninja still enters, tapped, but is never an
# attacking creature (CR 508.4a, 506.3c). Bot1's Guerrilla Gorilla attacks Bot2's Liliana of the Veil on turn 3, unblocked;
# Bot1 activates Kaito, Bane of Nightmares' ninjutsu returning the Gorilla, and in response Lightning Bolts Liliana, who dies
# (CR 704.5i). Kaito enters tapped and not attacking, and deals no combat damage: Bot2 stays at 20.

